        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-02T02:57:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, figuring I might be able to give a more exact answer I dug around for the post I made at the end of Oblivaeon's Kickstarter where I tried to lay out everything we were getting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm 90% certain the foil pack comes with a single copy of every single hero and every single variant, new and old.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We got 11 new heroes, each with a variant. (22)</p><p>....</p><p>And I just got to the part of my post were I already did this math once before</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Previously I had 110 cards in the foil pack and 67 cards in the hero variant pack. I shall stand by my previous work.</p>",
