        "id": 177981,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-02T13:43:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Powerhound_2000 wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>It's more than 100 cards for the foil heroes and yes it is the same size as the normal character cards.  \n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>Although I imagine their egos are quite a bit bigger.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I imagine they would be more humble than their normal variants. Seeing as how they’ve all been foiled.</p>",
