      {
        "id": 177983,
        "name": "arenson9",
        "username": "arenson9",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-02T22:33:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chaosmancer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/48/1977_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chaosmancer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>… I had 110 cards in the foil pack and 67 cards in the hero variant pack. …</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Interesting. My count is 109 and 67.</p>\n<p>Assuming the 67 is correct, that leaves either 42 or 43 for base character cards.</p>\n<p>Heroes:</p>\n<p>Base: 10</p>\n<p>RC, IR, ST, WC: 2 each for 8</p>\n<p>Vengeance: 5</p>\n<p>Mini-expansions, pre-OblivAeon: Unity, Scholar, Guise, for 3</p>\n<p>OblivAeon and additional mini-expansions: Luminary, Commodora, Harpy, Akash'Thriya, Lifeline, Stuntman, Benchmark, Void Guard, for 11&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Sentinels use three extra and Sky-Scraper uses 2 extra for 5</p>\n<p>That's 42.</p>\n<p>Now, if you want to print and sleeve Cleverest Legacy, that could get you to 110. Otherwise, am I missing one?!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also, the question to how many heroes does it take to save the Multiverse is, apparently, 42.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:02:04.286Z",
